Claim type: bounded_theorem

# Finite consumed memory banks for repeated readiness

**Primary-runner role: source integrity only.** The proposed 60-second primary checks exact source/review bodies, the one canonical mathematical parent, selected recovery evidence and an actual root binding. It does not simulate a physical system, establish a theorem, prepare memory or certify an audit outcome. It is unexecuted in this source-only draft and intentionally fails closed until root supplies the actual binding and complete declared receipt inputs.

For every declared finite number k of readiness episodes on a fixed old register S, one larger supplied correlated raw-memory ray can be reversibly compressed once into k approximate reset blocks. Returned routes then consume a distinct block at each episode, transfer the complete current S record there, and prepare the specified clock packet on the original sites. One full-bank comparison error is propagated through the sequence; every episode still pays its own turn-on, release, control, timing and isolation costs. The resulting full-state approximation retains all old records, used and unused bank blocks, garbage and reference factors.

The exact author source 162d7504 and separate assessment 16f6fbc7 are preserved below byte for byte, including historical status wording. The current source decision is root acceptance 5bf680cc, with its exact verification and freeze recorded in the packet. This wrapper applies the review's mandatory at-most compensation-action and chronological guard qualifications. It does not claim that source-only drafting has bound a checkout, executed the primary/cache/mutations/graph, opened a PR or obtained retained audit status.

## Quantified contract and the one mathematical parent

Let D be all original nonclock factors, X the original M-site clock, A its complete auxiliary register, S=A union X with s=|S|, and R the retained reference. Keep their sites and installed finite generator fixed:

    Z=D S R,  K_Z=H0+F_inst,  H0 acting only on D.

The literal F_inst and its positive local compensation, full gate dictionary, fixed connected S routing graph, ray geometry and synthesis domain are supplied by [Correlated memory delivery and complete joint readiness](CORRELATED_MEMORY_DELIVERY_AND_READINESS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-10-15.md), exactly 203,198 bytes, SHA256 12bd18b0d2a1939639027ed51204a066744eab77d2b105a870f89bdb286b4d89. Its accepted Markov body is 685db9bd and complete comparison c001e42e. This is the sole direct mathematical parent. The older joint-readiness and memory notes are transitive through that canonical parent; their Git ancestry is not an additional theorem hypothesis. Local-bias and rotated-Gibbs results are not needed for the claim here.

H0 need not commute with F_inst. Use the literal full-space bounds B_F>=||F_inst|| and positive local blocks C_alpha=c_alpha I-h_alpha, c_alpha>=||h_alpha||, so C=sum C_alpha=kappa I-F_inst>=0 and B_C>=||C||. Positivity of the complete nominal generator also requires the supplied installed K_Z>=0. A bound on a signed fault does not install a positivity reserve. Every scalar and every coefficient is part of the physical ledger.

Append the existing +x memory ray B, with nominal zero memory baseline after any separately paid delivery switch. Choose a finite integer k>=1 and n=k s. The first n ray sites form E_total, partitioned into E^(a)={B_((a-1)s+j):1<=j<=s}. All remaining raw sites form F. The initial joint density on ZB can have arbitrary coherences and arbitrary old/reference correlations. Its complete computational diagonal on the entire selected ray is a supplied finite stationary Markov law

    P=[[1-a,a],[b,1-b]],  q=a/(a+b)<1/2,
    a+b>0, 0<=a,b<=1, lambda=1-a-b, |lambda|<1,
    p(x)=pi_(x1) product_i P_(xi,x(i+1)), pi=(1-q,q),

or differs from that certified law by a supplied global event-TV allowance d_del. Quantitative computable certificates q<q_bar<1/2 and |lambda|<=lambda_bar<1 are required for effective finite choices. The premise is on the marginal diagonal, not on every reference-conditioned input. Neither product raw memory nor initial old/memory independence is required. A realized-state reference does not supply this particular law, its parameters, controls or basis; the registered primitive retains its narrower approved role.

The direct Markov route requires no initial source Hamiltonian or switch. If a delivery switch is included, its full contract is separately supplied and paid. For the parent's diagonal Gibbs interface, U_q=exp(-it_q K_Z) tensor exp(-i A_q G_B) retains the diagonal and all correlation phases. It ages the old system under K_Z for the actual t_q. A non-diagonal switch cannot be inferred from a diagonal-only promise; that optional extension is outside the mathematical dependency used here.

## One compression and its complete marginal

Choose ell>=1 with lambda_bar^ell<=q_bar-q, r>=1 and Q=3^r. Allocate

    x_(j,0)=j,
    x_(j,t)=n+[(j-1)(Q-1)+t]ell, 1<=j<=n, 1<=t<Q,
    L_raw=n+n(Q-1)ell.

The first gap is ell+h_j with h_j=n-j+(j-1)(Q-1)ell>=0, and later gaps are ell. Every endpoint stays at its prescribed first ray site. The parent Markov identity P^d(x,1)=q+lambda^d(x-q) bounds each selected sequential threshold by q_bar; recursive majority is increasing. If q_0=q_bar and q_(u+1)=3q_u^2-2q_u^3, the union of n bad endpoint events has probability at most n q_r. The outputs are not assumed independent. Global event-TV changes that single diagonal bad event by at most d_del:

    delta<=delta_bar=min(1,n q_r+d_del).

The completed U_c is the phase-exact memory-only permutation compiled from the full positive SWAP/CX/CV dictionary and returned dirty NN routes. Its counts, with n endpoints rather than s old sites, are

    P_c=(20ell r/3)nQ-(7/2)n(Q-1)
         +5r n(n-1)[1+(Q-1)ell],
    A_c=pi[P_c+n(Q-1)/4], scalar action=A_c/4.

The raw law is certified on all L_raw sites; k isolated promises about separate blocks are not silently substituted. All compression pulse durations, strengths, slew, phases and errors remain priced.

For the nominal delivered full state rho_q, set rho_c=U_c rho_q U_c*, omega=Tr_E_total rho_c and

    sigma_c=|0_E_total><0_E_total| tensor omega.

Then ||rho_c-sigma_c||_1<=g(delta_bar), where g(d)=d+sqrt(d(4-3d)). The norm is unhalved. This comparator preserves exactly the entire unconditioned D,S,R,F marginal of the modeled compression. It does not normalize a successful branch, discard F, erase a reference or physically reset the whole bank. The k blocks are exactly pure and independent only in this mathematical comparator. No such factorization is asserted on the actual cooled output.

## Accessing later blocks without overwriting earlier records

For old a_j in S choose a simple internal path to the fixed ray root of length ell_j<=s-1. The episode-a destination is B_((a-1)s+j). A forward SWAP path followed by its reverse with the final edge omitted is precisely the endpoint transposition, with every intermediate label restored on arbitrary entangled inputs. Its length and cost are ell_j+(a-1)s+j and twice that length minus one.

The disjoint endpoint pairs exchange S with E^(a). Hence

    P_J,a=(2a-1)s^2+2sum_j ell_j,
    sum_a P_J,a=k^2s^2+2k sum_j ell_j<=k^2s^2+2k s(s-1).

Earlier bank records can be temporary dirty transit. Each completed route restores them; no clean transit factor is supplied. On the ideal pure E^(a) input the current complete S record and its correlations move into E^(a), and S becomes vacuum. The parent positive excitation and complex synthesis word then prepares the specified computable normalized one-excitation psi_a on the original X with A vacuum. Different packets and schedules may be declared per episode. This does not provide a reader, feedback device or autonomous scheduler.

The consumed E^(a) is never reused as fresh input. A separately declared operation may later alter that stored record; such a change belongs to the target and does not imply automatic archival permanence.

## Chronological dynamics and the single global error

Episode 1 includes all compression in its compensated plateau. Later episodes contain only their reset and synthesis words. With u_a rising to 1, staying 1 throughout the plateau and falling to 0, the nominal generator is

    H_a(t)=H0+(1-u_a)F_inst+u_a kappa I+G_a(t).

Every actual gate, ramp and compensated guard contributes to T_a; A_u,a is the actual integral of u_a. H0 is never canceled. The ideal episode map is H0 aging for T_a composed with its full record-transfer/synthesis map. Between episodes, the supplied complete ideal propagator V_a must act as identity on every still-unused bank block. It has its own duration, Hamiltonian/control contract, endpoints and full-space residual budget. Environmental operations require their declared physical outputs; a free trace-out, reset or operation on an otherwise passive reference is not supplied.

Starting from sigma_c, the exact target is the ordered sequence C_k V_(k-1) C_(k-1) ... V_1 C_1, where C_a is the H0-aged episode comparator, and rho_q already contains the optional U_q. Episode 1's compression time is included in T_1 even though U_c is already used in sigma_c. H0 commutes by support with the memory/gate word, so this accounting does not omit or duplicate its earlier aging. The sequence generally is not one exponential of total H0 time; K_Z, H0 and V_a need not commute.

The ideal unused-bank purity invariant is maintained by the endpoint permutation and V_a's identity support. Errors on actual trajectories propagate by contractivity; purity is never reasserted on a faulty block. Compare the first full-space turn-on before compression, make the one g replacement at the ideal compression point, then use a ready-range release after reset/synthesis. Repeat only the episode ramp comparisons, not the memory replacement. With Gamma_a>=||F_inst J_ready(psi_a)|| on the entire retained complement,

    ||rho_actual_final-rho_target||_1 <= min(2,
      g(delta_bar)+sum_a[B_F r_on,a+Gamma_a r_off,a]
      +2 integral||E_q||+2sum_a integral||E_a||
      +2sum_(a<k) integral||E_V,a||).

All residuals are full-space actual-minus-specified generators over the complete physical timeline. A separately specified complete input error adds once for a fixed target. Delivery event-TV is already inside delta_bar. The complementary marginal in this target is that of the modeled compression, not a retargeted faulty physical midpoint; changing that target needs its own marginal-change allowance.

**Guard and wait qualification.** Guards counted solely as H0 aging must stay on a fully compensated plateau, u_a=1, and remain in T_a and A_u,a. An uncompensated interval evolves under K_Z. It must either appear as its actual ordered segment in the target, or add the relevant comparison residual integral: at most 2B_F g for a general wait of duration g, or 2Gamma_a g on the ready comparator. It is not a zero implementation fault merely because actual and nominal idle generators coincide. For H0=0, K_Z=I+X and ready |0>, an omitted idle has full trace error 2|sin g| from the H0 comparator. This witness is retained in the review; no unpriced duration is approved.

## Full scalar, control and geometry prices

The readiness pulse count, excluding source delivery and intervening controls, is

    G_tot=P_c+sum_a P_J,a+k(M+1).

With the inherited synthesis angles Theta_a and ell_phi,a, the exact gate action and scalar action are

    A_gate=A_c+pi(sum_a P_J,a+k)+2sum_a Theta_a+sum_a ell_phi,a,
    scalar_gate=A_c/4+(pi/4)sum_a P_J,a+k pi/2
                  +sum_a Theta_a+(1/2)sum_a ell_phi,a.

Exact compensation action is ||C||sum_a A_u,a and is **at most** B_C sum_a A_u,a. Its exact scalar action is (kappa-s_Finst)sum_a A_u,a. The prepared-map phase is exp[-i sum_a(kappa A_u,a+Theta_a)], in addition to all source-switch and intervening propagators. A physical scalar-action ledger is distinct from that phase-exact map. Historical wording in the author body calling the B_C allowance “action” is governed by this explicit qualification.

The inherited serial pulse with logarithm norm L_g and duration tau_g has action L_g, peak at most m0 L_g/tau_g, derivative peak at most m1 L_g/tau_g^2 and variation at most 2m0 L_g/tau_g. Compensation action and variation add across episodes; its total variation is at most 2k B_C. Serial peak is bounded by the maximum per-episode bound. Channel costs use the literal Pauli decomposition, including its scalars; the synthesis channel-action bound adds (sqrt(5)-1)sum_a Theta_a to A_gate. Every delivery/intervening segment needs its separate ledger. Bounded lattice degree alone does not bound physical coefficients, lifetime errors or bandwidth.

The fixed ray is B_j=(X_*+q_c+j,Y_*+q_c,4). Extending it changes neither the old S size s nor the original clock and auxiliary coordinates. Only B_1 has the parent's already inventoried extra old adjacency. The declared-edge count is m+4M+L_raw+9 and the safe full omitted-edge incidence bound is 6(s+L_raw), with **s**, not n. E_total is a subset of B, not an additional set of physical factors. Every old omitted edge, new memory field, unknown occupied neighbor and cross-coupling is absent nominally or charged over the whole bank lifetime. Fresh sites are not an isolation proof.

Tensoring the zero-baseline bank changes no old operator norm. If actual bank fields are included in the installed baseline, recompute compensation, B_F, Gamma_a, scalar/channel and moment bounds. An operator-norm state-error budget alone does not certify positivity, work or slew. Scalar moments, old/control covariance and retained-register moments keep the parent's centered/raw distinction and marginal-restoration terms. Formal work uses the actual segment endpoint Hamiltonians and all physical scalars. An initially removed source field makes the whole process different from a same-baseline cycle.

For fixed finite k,s and supplied strict margins, finite r and finite controls can reach any stated tolerance only under correspondingly improving delivery and implementation allowances. For example n q_r,d_del<=epsilon^2/72 makes g(delta_bar)<=epsilon/2; allocate the remaining entire dynamic sum at most epsilon/2. Growing k reprices n, L_raw, compression, the k^2 access count and the total lifetime. A fixed delivery or isolation-error floor is not removed by declaring more episodes. No common hardware-cap result is asserted.

## Review obligations, witnesses and scope

The proof obligations are: the parent's full-ray Markov domination and phase-exact circuit; the n-endpoint substitution and count sum proved in the source/review; the returned endpoint permutations; the one full-marginal g lemma; induction of purity only on the ideal unused blocks; the chronological three-part ramp proof; and complete resource/isolation accounting. No open mathematical lemma is hidden behind a desired native-supplier conclusion. The supplied physical law, state certification, basis, fresh factors, controls, compensation, timing and isolation remain hypotheses. A derivation of their native production or of bank restoration is outside this theorem, not an implicitly closed terminal step.

The narrow witnesses retained include a forward-only dirty route that overwrites an intermediate record, a flip of an unused bank block before its turn, the uncompensated-idle example, a loose B_C bound mistaken for equality, normalized-success replacement changing the complement, and a faulty-midpoint retargeting without its marginal allowance. These identify concrete substitutions; they do not constitute an exhaustive no-go for all memory mechanisms or a fabricated route quota.

After each use a new bank block contains that episode's displaced S record. F and every consumed block remain in the output. The supplied finite bank is consumed, not restored to a Markov/Gibbs law or returned for unlimited reuse. The result supplies no thermalization process, manufactured bath, native controller, measured-energy identification, permanent detector, saturated-pair result or full autonomous program. Arbitrary intervening changes to prior records are represented in the declared target.

The separate assessment is source-exposed and uses the same inherited model/effort and prior checked machinery. Root authored the candidate and supplied the intended issues; the reviewer reconstructed the new count, induction, timing and resource steps. Packaging is performed by that same reviewer and adds no independent mathematical check. Both bodies and the exact actual root acceptance are preserved without rewriting their historical wording. No scientific program or historical fixture was executed for the bank proof, its check or this packaging.

